<title>SOUTH KOREA: S.Korea Hankook Tire to invest offshore.</title>
<headline>S.Korea Hankook Tire to invest offshore.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hankook Tire Manufacturing Co Ltd plans to invest $1.2 billion by the year 2002 to build plants in China and Southeast Asia, a company spokesman said on Wednesday.</p>
</text>
